								<div class="item">
									<div class="item-image-2"><a href="https://doingbusiness.ro/articol/unde-si-cand-isi-pot-permite-liderii-de-business-sa-greseasca-9388"  class="img-link"><img src="https://doingbusiness.ro/media/covers/6af5aa64e639b_magda.jpg" class="img-responsive img-full" alt="Unde si cand isi pot permite liderii de business sa greseasca?" /></a></div>
									<div class="item-content">
										<div class="title-left title-style04 underline04">
											<h3><a href="https://doingbusiness.ro/articol/unde-si-cand-isi-pot-permite-liderii-de-business-sa-greseasca-9388" >Unde si cand isi pot permite liderii de business sa greseasca?</a></h3>
										</div>
										<p><a href="https://doingbusiness.ro/articol/unde-si-cand-isi-pot-permite-liderii-de-business-sa-greseasca-9388" >Autor: Constantin Magdalina, Expert Tendinte si Tehnologii Emergente</a></p>
										<div class="author-small">
